{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14233190","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14233190","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1423319001:1":{"text":"あんたたち！いやあ、すごいねえ。見かけによらず強いじゃないか！","source_cn":"是你们啊，真看不出来你们这么厉害。我还以为你们跟看起来...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1BC833FFE7FF62C6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1423319002:1":{"text":"狙ってた幻霊キノコはすごく凶暴なんだ。あんたたちがいなかったら、本当に危なかったかもね。","source_cn":"这次要捕猎的幻灵孢菇十分凶猛，如果不是有你们，可能真要...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x236E55CDB9D89135","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1423319003:1":{"text":"本で読んだことがあるわ。幻霊キノコは胞子で攻撃するだけでなく、人を惑わす幻影を作り出せるって。まさにその通りね。","source_cn":"我在书里读到过，幻灵孢菇会用孢子攻击人类，还会制造欺骗...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x41DBA3621BC56927","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1423319004:1":{"text":"でも、それを狩って食べるなんて、初めて聞いたわ。","source_cn":"但是人们会狩猎它作为食物，这我还是第一次知道。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1C4CCB26CED4C617","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1423319005:1":{"text":"平民街には、食べられるものが少ないからね。","source_cn":"毕竟平民区没有那么多可以吃的东西嘛。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3B4FA08D82041A44","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","documen